#: config.yaml:0
msgid "KDE Manifesto"
msgstr "Manifesto KDE"

#: config.yaml:0
msgid ""
"We are a community of technologists, designers, writers and advocates who "
"work to ensure freedom for all people through our software. These are our "
"values and principles."
msgstr ""
"Kami adalah komunitas yang terdiri dari para pakar teknologi, perancang, "
"penulis, dan advokat yang bekerja untuk memastikan kebebasan bagi semua "
"orang melalui perangkat lunak kami. Berikut ini adalah nilai dan prinsip "
"kami."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "The KDE Manifesto"
msgstr "Manifesto KDE"

#: content/_index.md:4
msgid ""
"<div class=\"text\">We are a community of technologists, designers, writers "
"and advocates who work to ensure freedom for all people through our "
"software. Because of this work we have come to value:</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"text\">Kami adalah komunitas yang terdiri dari para pakar "
"teknologi, perancang, penulis, dan advokat yang bekerja untuk memastikan "
"kebebasan bagi semua orang melalui perangkat lunak kami. Karena pekerjaan "
"ini, kami sangat menghargai:</div>\n"

#: content/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Open Governance</span> to ensure engagement in our "
"leadership and decision processes;"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"value\">Tata Kelola Terbuka</span> untuk memastikan "
"keterlibatan dalam proses kepemimpinan dan pengambilan keputusan;"

#: content/_index.md:8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Free Software</span> to ensure the result of our work "
"is available to all people for all time;"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"value\">Perangkat Lunak Bebas</span> untuk memastikan hasil "
"kerja kami tersedia bagi semua orang sepanjang masa;"

#: content/_index.md:10
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Inclusivity</span> to ensure that all people are "
"welcome to join us and participate;"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"value\">Inklusivitas</span> untuk memastikan bahwa semua orang "
"dapat bergabung dan berpartisipasi;"

#: content/_index.md:12
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Innovation</span> to ensure that new ideas constantly "
"emerge to better serve people;"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"value\">Inovasi</span> untuk memastikan bahwa ide-ide baru "
"selalu hadir untuk melayani masyarakat dengan lebih baik;"

#: content/_index.md:14
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Common Ownership</span> to ensure that we stay united;"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"value\">Kepemilikan Bersama</span> untuk memastikan bahwa kita "
"tetap bersatu;"

#: content/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">End-User Focus</span> to ensure our work is useful to "
"all people."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"value\">Fokus Pengguna Akhir</span> untuk memastikan bahwa "
"pekerjaan kami bermanfaat bagi semua orang."

#: content/_index.md:18
msgid ""
"<div class=\"text\">That is, in pursuit of our goal, we have found these "
"items essential to define and stay true to ourselves.</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"text\">Itulah sebabnya, dalam mengejar tujuan kami, kami telah "
"menemukan bahwa hal-hal ini sangat penting untuk didefinisikan dan tetap "
"setia pada diri kami sendiri.</div>\n"

#: content/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"<div class=\"addendum\">From those values we derived the <a href=\"../"
"benefits\">benefits</a> and <a href=\"../commitments\">commitments</a> of a "
"KDE Project.</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"Dari nilai-nilai tersebut, kami memperoleh <a href=\"../benefits\">manfaat</"
"a> dan <a href=\"../commitments\">komitmen</a> dari Proyek KDE.</div>\n"

#. title-benefits
#: content/benefits.md:0 i18n/en.yaml:6
msgid "Benefits of a KDE Project"
msgstr "Manfaat dari Proyek KDE"

#: content/benefits.md:0
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Manfaat"

#: content/benefits.md:10
msgid "Being part of the international KDE community conveys certain benefits:"
msgstr ""
"Menjadi bagian dari komunitas KDE internasional memberikan manfaat "
"tersendiri:"

#: content/benefits.md:12
msgid "To stand on the shoulders of giants"
msgstr "Untuk berdiri di pundak para raksasa"

#: content/benefits.md:13
msgid "Make use of KDE infrastructure for project hosting"
msgstr "Memanfaatkan infrastruktur KDE untuk hosting proyek"

#: content/benefits.md:14
msgid "Benefit from the experience of the KDE sysadmins"
msgstr "Mendapatkan manfaat dari pengalaman sysadmin KDE"

#: content/benefits.md:15
msgid ""
"Get support from the larger community with development, documentation, "
"translation, testing, bug handling, etc."
msgstr ""
"Mendapatkan dukungan dari komunitas yang lebih besar dalam hal pengembangan, "
"dokumentasi, penerjemahan, pengujian, penanganan bug, dll."

#: content/benefits.md:16
msgid ""
"Use opportunities to integrate with a large ecosystem of end-user products"
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan peluang untuk berintegrasi dengan ekosistem besar produk "
"pengguna akhir"

#: content/benefits.md:17
msgid ""
"Interaction with teams that have common values, leading to the cross-"
"pollination of ideas and innovations"
msgstr ""
"Berinteraksi dengan tim yang memiliki nilai-nilai yang sama, yang mengarah "
"pada penyerbukan silang ide dan inovasi"

#: content/benefits.md:18
msgid "Enjoy representation and support by KDE e.V."
msgstr "Menikmati representasi dan dukungan dari KDE e.V."

#: content/benefits.md:19
msgid "Participate in Akademy and other KDE events"
msgstr "Berpartisipasi dalam Akademy dan acara KDE lainnya"

#: content/benefits.md:20
msgid "Receive financial and organizational support"
msgstr "Menerima dukungan finansial dan organisasi"

#: content/benefits.md:21
msgid "Know that your trademarks can be secured"
msgstr "Mengetahui bahwa merek dagang Anda dapat diamankan"

#: content/benefits.md:22
msgid ""
"Know that your licensing wishes can be protected via the [Fiduciary "
"Licensing Agreement](https://ev.kde.org/rules/fla/)"
msgstr ""
"Mengetahui bahwa keinginan lisensi Anda dapat dilindungi melalui [Perjanjian "
"Lisensi Fidusia](https://ev.kde.org/rules/fla/)"

#: content/benefits.md:23
msgid ""
"Increase your visibility through the reputation of the KDE community and KDE "
"promotion tools such as:"
msgstr ""
"Meningkatkan visibilitas Anda melalui reputasi komunitas KDE dan alat "
"promosi KDE seperti:"

#: content/benefits.md:24
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "pushing project announcements to the Dot and employing other KDE "
#| "promotion channels"
msgid ""
"publishing project updates at [KDE Blogs](https://blogs.kde.org/) and "
"employing other KDE promotion channels"
msgstr ""
"mendorong pengumuman proyek ke Dot dan menggunakan saluran promosi KDE "
"lainnya"

#: content/benefits.md:25
msgid "having your project reachable through a subdomain under kde.org"
msgstr "membuat proyek Anda dapat dijangkau melalui subdomain di bawah kde.org"

#: content/benefits.md:26
msgid "having a \\#kde-<projectname\\> IRC channel on the Libera Chat network"
msgstr "memiliki saluran IRC \\#kde-<namaproyek\\> di jaringan Libera Chat"

#: content/benefits.md:27
msgid ""
"using KDE as an umbrella brand to associate with the KDE community for "
"communication on web sites and other channels"
msgstr ""
"menggunakan KDE sebagai merek induk untuk mengasosiasikan diri dengan "
"komunitas KDE, untuk komunikasi di situs web dan saluran lainnya"

#. title-commitments
#: content/commitments.md:0 i18n/en.yaml:8
msgid "Commitments of a KDE Project"
msgstr "Komitmen Proyek KDE"

#: content/commitments.md:0
msgid "Commitments"
msgstr "Komitmen"

#: content/commitments.md:10
msgid "The KDE Project designation carries with it certain commitments:"
msgstr "Penunjukan Proyek KDE membawa serta komitmen tertentu:"

#: content/commitments.md:12
msgid "Respect the [KDE Code of Conduct](https://kde.org/code-of-conduct/)"
msgstr "Hormati [Kode Etik KDE](https://kde.org/code-of-conduct/)"

#: content/commitments.md:13
msgid ""
"Support the [KDE Vision](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Vision) and [KDE "
"Mission](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Mission)"
msgstr ""
"Mendukung [Visi KDE](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Vision) dan [Misi KDE]"
"(https://community.kde.org/KDE/Mission)"

#: content/commitments.md:14
msgid "There is no mandatory Contributor License Agreement"
msgstr "Tidak ada Perjanjian Lisensi Kontributor yang bersifat wajib"

#: content/commitments.md:15
msgid "Technical requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan teknis"

#: content/commitments.md:16
msgid ""
"The project stays true to [established practices](https://community.kde.org/"
"Policies) common to similar KDE projects"
msgstr ""
"Proyek ini tetap setia pada [praktik-praktik yang sudah ada](https://"
"community.kde.org/Policies) yang umum digunakan pada proyek-proyek KDE yang "
"serupa"

#: content/commitments.md:17
msgid ""
"All source materials are hosted on infrastructure available to and writable "
"by all KDE contributor accounts"
msgstr ""
"Semua materi sumber dihosting pada infrastruktur yang tersedia dan dapat "
"ditulis oleh semua akun kontributor KDE"

#: content/commitments.md:18
msgid ""
"Online services associated with the project are either hosted on KDE "
"infrastructure or have an action plan that ensures continuity which is "
"approved by the KDE system administration team"
msgstr ""
"Layanan online yang terkait dengan proyek dihosting di infrastruktur KDE "
"atau memiliki rencana aksi yang memastikan keberlanjutan yang disetujui oleh "
"tim administrasi sistem KDE"

#: content/commitments.md:19
msgid "Copyrights, trademarks and patents"
msgstr "Hak cipta, merek dagang, dan paten"

#: content/commitments.md:20
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "[KDE licensing policy](https://community.kde.org/Policies/"
#| "Licensing_Policy) are respected"
msgid ""
"[KDE licensing policy](https://community.kde.org/Policies/Licensing_Policy) "
"is respected"
msgstr ""
"[Kebijakan lisensi KDE](https://community.kde.org/Policies/Licensing_Policy) "
"harus dipatuhi"

#: content/commitments.md:21
msgid "KDE branding guidelines are respected"
msgstr "Pedoman branding KDE harus dipatuhi"

#: content/commitments.md:22
msgid ""
"If the authors of the software abandon it or disappear, they agree to "
"transfer the trademark to the next maintainer"
msgstr ""
"Jika pembuat perangkat lunak meninggalkannya atau menghilang, mereka setuju "
"untuk mentransfer merek dagang ke pengelola berikutnya"

#: content/commitments.md:23
msgid ""
"If the code is covered by patents registered by the project itself, those "
"patents must be licensed freely"
msgstr ""
"Jika kode dilindungi oleh paten yang didaftarkan oleh proyek itu sendiri, "
"paten tersebut harus dilisensikan secara bebas"

#. displayed-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:3
msgid "Manifesto"
msgstr "Manifesto"

#. back-manifesto
#: i18n/en.yaml:10
msgid "Back to the manifesto"
msgstr "Kembali ke manifesto"

#. inspiration
#: i18n/en.yaml:12
msgid ""
"This manifesto is inspired by the [Agile](http://agilemanifesto.org/) and "
"[Software Craftmanship](http://manifesto.softwarecraftsmanship.org/) "
"manifestos."
msgstr ""
"Manifesto ini terinspirasi dari manifesto [Agile](http://agilemanifesto."
"org/) dan [Software Craftmanship](http://manifesto.softwarecraftsmanship."
"org/)."
